cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KinSTEP, please cite the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "KinSTEP: a verified microkinetic solver spanning thermal, electro-, photo- and sonocatalysis"
abstract: >-
  A pure-Python microkinetic modelling package whose numerical core is modality-agnostic:
  thermal, electrochemical, photochemical and sonochemical catalysis share one verified
  solver, with the external stimulus entering through a small driver interface.
